@identityUrl = http://localhost:5170
@bookingsUrl = http://localhost:5200
@password = FitCupo2026*

# Reservas consulta de forma síncrona a Clientes (5180) y a Clases (5190): deben estar en ejecución.
# Antes de reservar como afiliado, recepción debe registrar a afiliado@fitcupo.com en Clientes
# y un instructor debe programar una sesión en Clases. Reemplaza {sessionId} y {clientId}.
# (Visual Studio 2022 17.12 o superior, o la extensión REST Client de VS Code)

### ───────────── Inicio de sesión ─────────────

# @name loginMember
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "afiliado@fitcupo.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name loginReception
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "recepcion@fitcupo.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
# @name loginInstructor
POST {{identityUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "instructor@fitcupo.com", "password": "{{password}}" }

### ───────────── Horario con cupos (Reservas → Clases) ─────────────

### Horario de los próximos 7 días con los cupos disponibles (200 OK)
GET {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ───────────── Reservar (Reservas → Clientes y Clases) ─────────────

### El afiliado reserva para sí mismo (201 Created)
POST {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{sessionId}" }

### Recepción reserva para un cliente (201 Created)
POST {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginReception.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{sessionId}", "clientId": "{clientId}" }

### Mis reservas próximas (200 OK)
GET {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings/me?upcomingOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Todas las reservas próximas, solo recepción y administrador (200 OK)
GET {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings?upcomingOnly=true&status=Confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{loginReception.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Inscritos de una sesión del instructor (200 OK; 403 si la sesión es de otro instructor)
GET {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings/sessions/{sessionId}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginInstructor.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Cancelar una reserva (204 No Content)
PATCH {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings/{bookingId}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ───────────── Errores ─────────────

### Reservar dos veces la misma sesión (409 Conflict)
POST {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{sessionId}" }

### Sesión que no existe en Clases (404 Not Found)
POST {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }

### Recepción sin indicar el cliente (400 Bad Request)
POST {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginReception.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{sessionId}" }

### Instructor intenta reservar (403 Forbidden)
POST {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{loginInstructor.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": "{sessionId}" }

### Sin token (401 Unauthorized)
GET {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings/me

### Con el microservicio de Clases detenido, el horario responde 503 Service Unavailable
GET {{bookingsUrl}}/api/bookings/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMember.response.body.$.accessToken}}
